<title>POLAND: Scale of Polfa Kutno rise baffles traders.</title>
<headline>Scale of Polfa Kutno rise baffles traders.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish pharmeceuticals firm Polfa Kutno SA, Friday's top gainer, jumped 10 percent to 104.5 zlotys in a 4.1-million-zloty turnover but analysts could not explain the scale of the surge.</p>
<p>&quot;I can't think of any news which could cause such a surge, but it's a good company so no one can be suprised it's rising,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>They said it was difficult to say whether the stock would fall in profit-taking or extend its gains in the next sessions.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
